+# [INVESTIGATE · step 4] A second write-up, given as sample data — predict: will the site show it?
+title: Five findings from a hospital app pen test
+date: 2026-05-02
+---
+
+A two-week test of a patient portal, done with the hospital's permission and a signed scope.
+
+1. Appointment IDs could be guessed, exposing other patients' bookings
+2. Password reset links never expired
+3. Uploaded files were served from the main domain
+4. The admin panel was reachable from the internet
+5. Logs stored full session tokens
+
+Every finding came with a fix, and a retest two weeks later.
